@startuml 实验通信框架业务流程图

skinparam handwritten false
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam defaultFontName "微软雅黑"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam roundCorner 15
skinparam ArrowColor #3498DB
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #2E86C1
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #D6EAF8
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #AED6F1
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #2874A6
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #2874A6
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBackgroundColor #D6EAF8
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FCF3CF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #F1C40F
skinparam TitleFontSize 20
skinparam TitleFontColor #2C3E50
skinparam TitleFontStyle bold
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #EAEDED
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #95A5A6

title 实验通信框架业务流程图

participant "客户端应用" as Client
participant "SpinQLabLink" as LabLink
participant "设备管理器\nDevice" as Device
participant "TCP连接\nTCPConnection" as TCPConnection
participant "协议处理\nProtocol" as Protocol
participant "实验管理器\nExperimentManager" as ExperimentManager
participant "实验实例\nExperiment" as Experiment
participant "服务器" as Server
participant "心跳管理器\nHeartbeatManager" as Heartbeat

== 初始化与连接阶段 ==

Client -> LabLink: 创建SpinQLabLink(host, port, account, password)
activate LabLink

LabLink -> TCPConnection: 创建TCP连接(host, port)
activate TCPConnection
LabLink -> Protocol: 创建协议处理器
activate Protocol
LabLink -> Device: 创建设备实例(device_id)
activate Device
LabLink -> ExperimentManager: 创建实验管理器()
activate ExperimentManager
LabLink -> Heartbeat: 创建心跳管理器
activate Heartbeat

Client -> LabLink: connect()
LabLink -> TCPConnection: connect()
TCPConnection -> Server: 建立TCP连接
activate Server
Server --> TCPConnection: 连接成功
TCPConnection --> LabLink: 返回连接结果

LabLink -> Protocol: 序列化登录消息
Protocol --> LabLink: 返回序列化后的消息
LabLink -> TCPConnection: 发送登录请求
TCPConnection -> Server: 发送登录消息
Server --> TCPConnection: 返回登录响应
TCPConnection -> LabLink: 接收登录响应
LabLink -> Protocol: 反序列化消息
Protocol --> LabLink: 返回消息内容
LabLink -> LabLink: 处理登录响应

LabLink -> Heartbeat: 启动心跳
Heartbeat -> TCPConnection: 定期发送心跳包
TCPConnection -> Server: 心跳消息
Server --> TCPConnection: 心跳响应
TCPConnection --> Heartbeat: 接收心跳响应

note right of Server
  服务器发送设备参数
end note

Server -> TCPConnection: 发送设备参数
TCPConnection -> LabLink: 接收设备参数
LabLink -> Protocol: 反序列化设备参数
Protocol --> LabLink: 返回设备参数内容
LabLink -> Device: 设置设备参数
Device --> LabLink: 更新完成

== 实验注册与参数设置阶段 ==

Client -> LabLink: register_experiment(experimentType)
LabLink -> ExperimentManager: register_experiment(experimentType, handler_map)
ExperimentManager -> ExperimentManager: 动态加载实验类
ExperimentManager -> Experiment: 创建实验实例和参数
activate Experiment
Experiment -> Experiment: 注册消息处理函数到handler_map
Experiment --> ExperimentManager: 返回实验实例
ExperimentManager --> LabLink: 返回实验实例和参数
LabLink --> Client: 返回实验实例和参数

Client -> Experiment: 设置实验参数
Experiment --> Client: 参数设置完成

== 实验执行阶段 ==

Client -> LabLink: run_experiment()
LabLink -> ExperimentManager: get_experiment_parameter()
ExperimentManager -> Experiment: get_experiment_parameter()
Experiment --> ExperimentManager: 返回实验参数
ExperimentManager --> LabLink: 返回实验参数

LabLink -> Protocol: 序列化实验参数
Protocol --> LabLink: 返回序列化后的消息
LabLink -> TCPConnection: 发送实验参数
TCPConnection -> Server: 发送实验参数

note right of Server
  服务器开始处理实验
end note

Server -> TCPConnection: 发送实验已添加响应
TCPConnection -> LabLink: 接收响应
LabLink -> Protocol: 反序列化响应
Protocol --> LabLink: 返回消息内容
LabLink -> Experiment: handle_exp_added(data)
Experiment -> Experiment: 处理实验添加响应

Server -> TCPConnection: 发送实验开始通知
TCPConnection -> LabLink: 接收通知
LabLink -> Protocol: 反序列化通知
Protocol --> LabLink: 返回消息内容
LabLink -> Experiment: handle_exp_started(data)
Experiment -> Experiment: 更新实验状态为运行中

loop 实验步骤执行
    Server -> TCPConnection: 发送步骤变更通知
    TCPConnection -> LabLink: 接收通知
    LabLink -> Protocol: 反序列化通知
    Protocol --> LabLink: 返回消息内容
    LabLink -> Experiment: handle_exp_step_changed(step)
    Experiment -> Experiment: 更新当前步骤
    
    Server -> TCPConnection: 发送实验数据更新
    TCPConnection -> LabLink: 接收数据
    LabLink -> Protocol: 反序列化数据
    Protocol --> LabLink: 返回消息内容
    LabLink -> Experiment: handle_exp_data_updated(data)
    Experiment -> Experiment: 处理实验数据
    
    Server -> TCPConnection: 发送图表数据开始更新
    TCPConnection -> LabLink: 接收通知
    LabLink -> Protocol: 反序列化通知
    Protocol --> LabLink: 返回消息内容
    LabLink -> Experiment: handle_exp_chart_data_updated_started(data)
    Experiment -> Experiment: 准备接收图表数据
    
    Server -> TCPConnection: 发送图表数据
    TCPConnection -> LabLink: 接收数据
    LabLink -> Protocol: 反序列化数据
    Protocol --> LabLink: 返回消息内容
    LabLink -> Experiment: handle_exp_chart_data_updated(data)
    Experiment -> Experiment: 处理图表数据
    
    Server -> TCPConnection: 发送图表数据更新完成
    TCPConnection -> LabLink: 接收通知
    LabLink -> Protocol: 反序列化通知
    Protocol --> LabLink: 返回消息内容
    LabLink -> Experiment: handle_exp_chart_data_updated_finished(data)
    Experiment -> Experiment: 完成图表数据处理
end

note right of Server
  实验执行完成
end note

Server -> TCPConnection: 发送实验完成通知
TCPConnection -> LabLink: 接收通知
LabLink -> Protocol: 反序列化通知
Protocol --> LabLink: 返回消息内容
LabLink -> Experiment: handle_exp_finished(data)
Experiment -> Experiment: 更新实验状态为已完成
Experiment -> Experiment: 处理最终结果数据

== 等待实验完成 ==

Client -> LabLink: wait_for_experiment_completion()
LabLink -> ExperimentManager: wait_for_experiment_completion()
ExperimentManager -> Experiment: 轮询get_status()
Experiment --> ExperimentManager: 返回实验状态
ExperimentManager --> LabLink: 实验已完成
LabLink --> Client: 实验已完成

== 获取实验结果 ==

Client -> LabLink: get_experiment_result()
LabLink -> ExperimentManager: get_experiment_result()
ExperimentManager -> Experiment: get_result()
Experiment --> ExperimentManager: 返回实验结果
ExperimentManager --> LabLink: 返回实验结果
LabLink --> Client: 返回实验结果

== 断开连接阶段 ==

Client -> LabLink: disconnect()
LabLink -> Protocol: 序列化登出消息
Protocol --> LabLink: 返回序列化后的消息
LabLink -> TCPConnection: 发送登出请求
TCPConnection -> Server: 发送登出消息
Server --> TCPConnection: 返回登出响应
TCPConnection -> LabLink: 接收登出响应

LabLink -> Heartbeat: 停止心跳
deactivate Heartbeat

LabLink -> TCPConnection: disconnect()
TCPConnection -> Server: 断开连接
Server --> TCPConnection: 连接断开
deactivate Server
TCPConnection --> LabLink: 断开连接完成
deactivate TCPConnection

LabLink -> ExperimentManager: 注销实验
ExperimentManager -> Experiment: 清理实验资源
deactivate Experiment
deactivate ExperimentManager
deactivate Device
deactivate Protocol
deactivate LabLink

@enduml 